</td>
<td valign="top" width="201">
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;">&nbsp;R$ 2.002,00 / m&ecirc;s</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;">&nbsp;R$ 9,10 / hora</span></p>
